    "detailed_description": "Embark on a geometric adventure in F.I.T. Your reflexes and spatial awareness will be put to the test as a square with the ability to transform into a nimble rectangle or a sharp-edged triangle, your mission is to fit into falling pieces before the play area reaches its limits. Try your best to get the highest score possible!",
